  "description": {
    "pve": {
      "en": "Spell. Create a sandstorm at your location that lasts 3 seconds. Each second, foes nearby this location take 10...34...40 earth damage. Attacking foes take an additional 10...18...20 damage. If you are enchanted when you cast this spell, it lasts twice as long.",
